# RSPICE-VERILOG-STIMULUS 1
#
# One rising edge and one falling edge per vector, at `k*10 + 5` and
# `k*10 + 10`, sampled at `k*10 + 8` between them. Every vector carries a
# different word, so a half-cycle of lag is visible on every observation but
# the first.

module edge_forms

input clk 1
input d 4

output rise 4
output fall 4

clock clk 5
step 10
settle 8

vector 0011
vector 0101
vector 1001
vector 1110
vector 0110
